oReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"This was already a great board anyway, even with the Z690 chipset, so there is nothing to improve.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/NLPCaXGCPc8/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">This was already a great board anyway, even with the Z690 chipset, so there is nothing to improve.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"I like that the board has a bunch of connectors for RGB in 5V and 12V varieties and that you also have a bunch of connectors for fans.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/ILxHU1MlKK4/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">I like that the board has a bunch of connectors for RGB in 5V and 12V varieties and that you also have a bunch of connectors for fans.</p></div></li><li class=\"ActionVideo__actionVideoContent__VSBOn ActionVideo__reviewVideo__ItQ8T ProductAwardVideo__videoReviewItem__r730n\"><button type=\"link\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"VideoButton__videoButton__XVz9e VideoButton__overviewVideoButton__d9DBl ActionVideo__videoBtn__bsfVJ\"><span class=\"sr-only\">play</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" svg-inline role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M2.24 12a14.32 14.32 0 0127.52 0h1.74a16 16 0 00-31 0zm27.52 8a14.32 14.32 0 01-27.52 0H.5a16 16 0 0031 0z\"></path></svg></button> <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Today I have one of those on test - it's the ASUS ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II model, which is decorated with a new visual identity, brings a very powerful VRM, a new generation of wireless connectivity and a handful of M.2 slots.\" class=\"ActionVideo__videoImage__MDnor\" style=\"background-image:url(https://img.youtube.com/vi/ILxHU1MlKK4/hqdefault.jpg);\"></div> <!----> <!----> <div class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionsItemContent__b+fib AwardVideoContent__reviewType__isoMH\"><p class=\"AwardVideoContent__actionTitle__9KMXz\">Today I have one of those on test - it's the ASUS ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II model, which is decorated with a new visual identity, brings a very powerful VRM, a new generation of wireless connectivity and a handful of M.2 slots.</p></div></li></ul></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoMoreButton__h9Vas\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Video review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-media\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Media_review\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__productAwardPagePadding__LFeX-\"><div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__line__Z71fT\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaTitle__t55HQ\"><h2 class=\"pageMedia vnRogFont ProductAwardMedia__vnRogFontSize__ARdRa\">\n        Media review\n      </h2> <span style=\"display:;\">(8)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__mobileMediaContent__C6DyG\"><ul class=\"ProductAwardMedia__awardMediaContainer__M6cwI\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hardware Cooking\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202010271616057320631.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ... apart from the motherboard and CPU, we're staying with the same components, with the small exception that we're moving from a Ryujin II 360 to a Ryujin III 360 for this 14th generation of Intel CPUs.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Hardware Cooking\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of Hardware Cooking\" href=\"https://www.hardwarecooking.fr/test-intel-core-i9-14900k/2/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Clubic\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202010271610385120931.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The Core i7-14700K is one of the most powerful processors on the market, yet at the same time it comes at an almost affordable price. In terms of performance per dollar spent, it's quite simply the best processor we've come across…\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Clubic\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/19/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of Clubic\" href=\"https://www.clubic.com/test-produit-505933-test-intel-core-i7-14700k-plus-de-c-urs-moins-de-chauffe-et-si-c-etait-lui-le-vrai-raptor-lake-refresh.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Comptoir Du Hardware\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202008311917486040301.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      This card has all the same features as the first version. The ROG Strix Z790-E Gaming WIFI II has the same all-black exterior as the first, and [...] there's not much to tell them apart at first glance, but there's plenty to go on.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Comptoir Du Hardware\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>10/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of Comptoir Du Hardware\" href=\"https://www.comptoir-hardware.com/articles/cpu-mobo-ram/47288-test-intel-core-i9-14900k-a-core-i5-14600k.html?start=2\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CT.nl\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202010301701387630066.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      All in all, the ROG Strix Z790-E Wifi II is not only suitable for gamers, but also for users who strive for a state-of-the-art motherboard that complies with emerging standards such as Wi-Fi 7 and PCIe 5.0.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      CT.nl\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>12/05/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of CT.nl\" href=\"https://www.ct.nl/reviews/asus-rog-strix-z790-e-gaming-wifi-ii-review/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"pcmarket.com\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202008211757299360306.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS updated DDR5 Z790 models and you should know that different model is for different users with different needs\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      pcmarket.com\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>11/02/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of pcmarket.com\" href=\"https://www.pcmarket.com.hk/asus-rog-14gen-z790-motherboard/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TuttoTech\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202107261541578220249.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      ASUS ROG Strix Z790-E Gaming WiFi II is an ATX board that stands out for its classic aggressive and original design in full ROG style; extended dissipation for VRM and SSD ensures full control of operating temperatures, with the possibility of operating out of specification by even trying its hand at extreme overclocking sessions.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      TuttoTech\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>11/25/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of TuttoTech\" href=\"https://www.tuttotech.net/computer/intel-core-i7-14700k-recensione.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hardware Upgrade\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1281/202008281753592080556.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The build quality of the Z790-E GAMING WIFI II is undoubtedly high, as is generally the case with all ASUS ROG Strix and ROG Maximus models, and the styling is undoubtedly refined. The product therefore looks to an undoubtedly sophisticated audience with a large wallet, after all 600 euros for a motherboard is a significant investment that only those with special needs can make.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Hardware Upgrade\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>ITALY</span> <span>11/02/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of Hardware Upgrade\" href=\"https://www.hwupgrade.it/news/skmadri/rog-strix-z790-e-gaming-wifi-ii-una-maximus-sotto-mentite-spoglie_121356.html\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItem__q7gyE\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemTop__AvYOk\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mezha.Media\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaImageBox__wHmrh\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1353/202112171634459780429.png);\"><!----></div> <p class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaDescription__GXkLd\">\n      The platform used the newly introduced ASUS ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II motherboard on the Intel Z790 chipset.\n    </p> <h3 class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardMediaName__VGyRp\">\n      Mezha.Media\n    </h3></div> <div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottom__YN1CY\"><div class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__awardItemBottomLeft__qC0ZC\"><span>UKRAINE</span> <span>10/17/2023</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX Z790-E GAMING WIFI II media of Mezha.Media\" href=\"https://mezha.media/articles/intel-core-i9-14900k-review/\" tabindex=\"0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductReviewMediaItem__mediaItemMoreLink__-qKRC\" style=\"display:;\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardMedia__rewardMoreButton__7-dJ4\" style=\"display:none;\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllButton__dIrKX seeAllButton__visible__OJDnB\"><button tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Xem tất cả Media review\" class=\"robotoFont seeAllButton__text__TNQDv\"><span>\n      Xem tất cả\n    </span> <svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" svg-inline alt role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M6 9.55l-5-5V2.5l5 5 5-5v2.05l-5 5z\" fill=\"#181818\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div> <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"https://rog.asus.com/rog/nuxtStatic/js/overview.js\"></script> <!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div> <!----> <!----></div></main>"}